What are Sports Collectible Cards?
Sports collectible cards are physical or digital cards featuring athletes, teams, or sporting events, typically containing images, statistics, and other relevant information. These cards gain value through their rarity, autographs, or limited-edition status. While baseball cards pioneered the market, modern collections now span basketball, football (both American and association/soccer), hockey, and other sports.
